message: "If you use this software in scientific work, please cite it."
title: "GPU Quantum Interferometry Solver (GQIS)"
authors:
  - family-names: "Ivakhnenko"
    given-names: "Oleh"
version: "0.2.0"
date-released: "2026-09-09"
abstract: "GQIS converts symbolic Lindblad models and general ordinary differential equations into CUDA kernels for large parameter and initial-condition sweeps, with selectable fixed-step integrators and accuracy-calibration benchmarks."
keywords:
  - quantum interferometry
  - Lindblad master equation
  - ordinary differential equations
  - CUDA
  - GPU
  - SymPy
  - CuPy
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Olegiv95/Gpu-Quantum-Interferometry-Solver"
